          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much does shipping container delivery cost?",
            "answer": "<p>Delivery is typically included in the total container quote, but the exact cost depends on your location and container size. We offer transparent, all-in pricing — no hidden fees. You can get an instant quote by entering your ZIP code.</p>"
